# LLM Rules for This Project

## Git Commit Rules

**NEVER include AI attribution in git commits.**

DO NOT include:
- "🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)"
- "Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>"
- Any mention of Claude, AI, or automated generation
- Any emojis in commit messages

This is a tool, not a contributor. Keep all AI references out of git history.
